{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This demo of The Box of Fear presents the beginning of the story \u2014 with the prologue and the first act of the main plot.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the role of <strong>Mark</strong> as he begins to investigate the mysterious disappearance of his daughter Sarah, crossing the first corridors of a forgotten facility and finding clues that lead to the enigmatic organization known as <i>&quot;The Box&quot;.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is included in the demonstration:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game's claustrophobic atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Initial elements of the narrative</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzles and key items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First encounter with a threat that cannot be faced \u2014 <u>only avoided</u></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Average duration:</strong> 25 to 50 minutes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Would you open the box?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version will feature new locations, more complex puzzles, deeper character development, and the complete story behind the mystery.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916600?t=1754438549","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916600?t=1754438549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916600/1d0b34bf2e8befc65f0dc3e69b0d65c94fd6b31e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754438549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916600/1d0b34bf2e8befc65f0dc3e69b0d65c94fd6b31e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754438549","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The Box of Fear Demo contains psychological horror and graphic violence, including blood visuals, jump scares, and disturbing ambient audio."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This demo of The Box of Fear presents the beginning of the story \u2014 with the prologue and the first act of the main plot.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the role of <strong>Mark</strong> as he begins to investigate the mysterious disappearance of his daughter Sarah, crossing the first corridors of a forgotten facility and finding clues that lead to the enigmatic organization known as <i>&quot;The Box&quot;.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is included in the demonstration:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game's claustrophobic atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Initial elements of the narrative</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzles and key items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First encounter with a threat that cannot be faced \u2014 <u>only avoided</u></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Average duration:</strong> 25 to 50 minutes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Would you open the box?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version will feature new locations, more complex puzzles, deeper character development, and the complete story behind the mystery.</p>","developers":["Escapebox"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Bruno da Silva Lopes ","fullgame":{"appid":"3881960","name":"The Box of Fear"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.